# Theme directory hardening.
#
# Files that live in this repo for development but must never be served to
# visitors. Without this, e.g. /wp-content/themes/astra-child/CLAUDE.md is
# publicly readable and exposes the project's structure and infrastructure.

# Markdown docs (CLAUDE.md, README.md) and macOS metadata.
#
# .json is safe to deny here: the only JSON in this repo is local dev config
# (.mcp.json, .claude/launch.json). No theme asset is fetched as JSON at
# runtime, so nothing on the front end depends on these being reachable.
<FilesMatch "(\.md|\.json|\.DS_Store)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
